label 49
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
label 50
setvar strS[1001] = ""
setvar intF[1113] = 0
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
text Tomoyo will certainly enter the student council.
text It's her we're talking about, so I think she'll definitely turn those dreams of hers into reality.
text Tomoyo has no desires in this world. For her, nothing exists but the dreams she has set for herself.
text Meaning that all she can do is walk on straight ahead on this path of hers, overcoming any obstacles she faces.
text I think she should be able to walk that path, supported by the people around her.
text Although I don't know whether it's her destiny, or whether this is just something she attained by personal virtue...
text It's just that I feel that that is the kind of future she will have.
text And as I hold her in my arms, I become sure of it.
if rtf1 != ""
	jump $rtf1 $rtl1
fi
jump $rtf0 $rtl0
